{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","裂爆屠戮"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","爆裂の猛斧"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","高举战斧砸向敌人，对目标及周围敌人造成伤害并回复自身。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","斧で敵を攻撃し、対象とその周囲の敵にダメージを与え、自身のHPを回復"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一名敌人为目标，喀尔马高举战斧砸向目标，对目标造成400% + 40% ATK的伤害以及2.5秒眩晕。1秒后，战斧砸下位置产生半径1格的爆炸，对敌人造成400% + 50% ATK的基础伤害并外加上次施放该技能后喀尔马受到治疗效果总和40%的额外伤害，额外伤害至多不超过自身500% ATK，爆炸每命中一个非召唤物敌人都会恢复自身10% HP的生命值，并且战斗中每死亡一名非召唤物敌人都会使该效果额外回复等量的生命值。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","敵1体を選択し、斧で対象に400% + 40% ATKのダメージを与え、2.5秒間のスタンを付与。1秒後、爆発を起こし、対象とその周囲1マス以内の敵に400% + 50% ATKの基礎ダメージを与え、追加で前回のこのスキル発動後にカーマが受けた回復効果の合計値×40%のダメージを与える（追加ダメージはカーマの500% ATKを超えない）。爆発がヒットした召喚ユニット以外の敵1体につき、自身のHPを10% HP分回復。さらに、戦闘中に撃破された召喚ユニット以外の敵1体につき、追加で同量のHPを回復"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":37,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":82,"end":88,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":79,"end":85,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":78,"end":92,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":139,"end":147,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":167,"end":173,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":75,"end":89,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":155,"end":163,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":200,"end":206,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","爆炸造成的基础伤害提升至420% + 50% ATK，命中敌人为自身回复最大生命值的比例提升至11%。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","爆発による基礎ダメージが420% + 50% ATKにUP。爆発がヒットした敵1体につき、自身のHPをHP上限×11%分回復"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","爆炸造成的基础伤害提升至440% + 50% ATK，命中敌人为自身回复最大生命值的比例提升至12%。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","爆発による基礎ダメージが440% + 50% ATKにUP。爆発がヒットした敵1体につき、自身のHPをHP上限×12%分回復"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","爆炸造成的基础伤害提升至460% + 50% ATK，命中敌人为自身回复最大生命值的比例提升至13%。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","爆発による基礎ダメージが460% + 50% ATKにUP。爆発がヒットした敵1体につき、自身のHPをHP上限×13%分回復"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","爆炸造成的基础伤害提升至500% + 50% ATK，命中敌人为自身回复最大生命值的比例提升至15%。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","爆発による基礎ダメージが500% + 50% ATKにUP。爆発がヒットした敵1体につき、自身のHPをHP上限×15%分回復"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","狂斧毒宴"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","毒宴の狂斧"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","在当前位置留下药池为自身提供回复，并挥动战斧劈砍周围敌人。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","現在位置に薬剤の沼を生成し、自身のHPを回復。一方、斧を振り、周囲の敵を攻撃"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","喀尔使用大量亡灵药剂沐浴全身，原地留下一滩持续6秒，半径1格的药剂池。药剂池每秒会对范围内的敌人造成100% + 10% ATK的伤害，并为喀尔马回复140% + 20% ATK的生命值。同时马尔挥动战斧，对周围的敌人造成300% + 30% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","大量のグレイヴボーンの薬剤を浴びたカーが、自身を中心に半径1マスの薬剤の沼を6秒間生成。範囲内にいる間、敵は毎秒100% + 10% ATKのダメージを受け、カーマは毎秒自身のHPを140% + 20% ATK分回復。一方、マーは斧を振り、周囲の敵に300% + 30% ATKのダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":54,"end":60,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":79,"end":85,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":115,"end":121,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":60,"end":66,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":95,"end":101,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":129,"end":135,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":50,"end":64,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":75,"end":89,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":111,"end":125,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":56,"end":70,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":91,"end":105,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":125,"end":139,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每秒为自身回复的生命值提升至160% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/