/cn","喀尔喝下药剂，使自身每秒回复20%最大生命值，持续5秒。随后马尔快速挥动战斧，对半径1格扇形范围内德敌人造成3次劈砍，每次造成140% + 20% ATK的伤害，最后一击还会将目标击倒，使其倒地2秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","カーが薬剤を飲み、5秒間、毎秒HP上限×20%分のHPを回復。服薬後、マーが斧で前方の半径1マスの扇状範囲内の敵に3連続斬りを繰り出し、斬撃1回につき140% + 20% ATKのダメージを与え、最後の一撃で対象を2秒間ノックダウンさせる"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":67,"end":73,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":79,"end":85,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":63,"end":77,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":75,"end":89,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次劈砍造成的伤害提升至160% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","斬撃1回ごとのダメージが160% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次劈砍造成的伤害提升至180% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","斬撃1回ごとのダメージが180% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次劈砍造成的伤害提升至200% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","斬撃1回ごとのダメージが200% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中提升受愈。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の治癒UP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，喀尔马获得11点受愈。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の治癒+11"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，喀尔马获得15点受愈。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の治癒+15"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，喀尔马获得19点受愈。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の治癒+19"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","血怒杀意"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","血の憤怒"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","受到治疗后会提升自身最大生命值，并为自身提供额外的护甲魔抗与韧性。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","一定量以上の回復を受けると、HP上限、物理・魔法防御力、根性がUP"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","喀尔马的肉体每次受到治愈都会变得更加强大，每受到自身初始最大生命值35%的治疗量可以使当前最大生命值增加40%，最多因此提升200%，并使自身体型略微增大。满层后自身额外提高60%护甲与魔抗和50点韧性，并使“裂爆屠戮”，“狂斧毒宴”，“亢奋杀心”的伤害范围增加一格。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","カーマの肉体は回復を受けるたびに強化される。受けたHP回復量が自身の初期HP上限×35%に達するたびに、自身のHP上限+40%（最大で+200%まで）、HP上限の上昇に応じて体も大きくなる。HP上限上昇量が最大に達した後、さらに自身の物理・魔法防御+60%、根性+50、「爆裂の猛斧」「毒宴の狂斧」「昂る殺意」のダメージ範囲+1マス"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","最大生命值的增加比例提升至45%，该效果的上限提升至225%，满层后自身额外提高70%护甲与魔抗。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","HP上限の上昇量が45%にUPし、上昇量の最大値が225%にUP。最大値到達後の物理・魔法防御上昇量が70%にUP"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","来自该技能的最大生命值提升至上限后，喀尔马会永久处于稳定状态，并且技能“狂斧毒宴”、“亢奋杀心”中战斧的攻击命中敌人时会附带15% HP的魔法伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","HP上限上昇量が最大に達した後、永続的に安定状態になり、スキル「毒宴の狂斧」または「昂る殺意」の斧攻撃が敵にヒットした時、追加で15% HPの魔法ダメージを与える"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"},{"start":62,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":20,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"},{"start":64,"end":70,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","最大生命值的增加比例提升至50%，上限提升至250%，满层后获得80%护甲与魔抗。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","HP上限の上昇量が50%にUPし、上昇量の最大値が250%にUP。最大値到達後の物理・魔法防御上昇量が80%にUP"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","受到药水影响后降低受到的伤害。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身の薬剤の影響を受けている間、被ダメージDOWN"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","喀尔马受到自身药水的影响期间，受到的伤害降低50%。该效果无法叠加。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","自身の薬剤の影響を受けている間、被ダメージ-50%、重複不可"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","双颅战斧"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","双頭の戦斧"]]}